[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1321.669, "timestamp": "00:22:01", "text": "是的，这里所有能要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1325.75, "timestamp": "00:22:05", "text": "你命的东西都在这里。 嗯，敌人就在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1326.39, "timestamp": "00:22:06", "text": "我们面前。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1329.27, "timestamp": "00:22:09", "text": "呃，绯红女巫，钢铁侠。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1331.029, "timestamp": "00:22:11", "text": "我感觉浑身无力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1334.789, "timestamp": "00:22:14", "text": "我很确定。 嗯，海拉和惩罚者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1337.19, "timestamp": "00:22:17", "text": "比如，尝试做所有这些事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1344.549, "timestamp": "00:22:24", "text": "它们会要了你的命。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1347.27, "timestamp": "00:22:27", "text": "我不会再犯同样的错误了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1349.19, "timestamp": "00:22:29", "text": "而且，如果是整个团队，甚至不需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1351.029, "timestamp": "00:22:31", "text": "像“全部”那样。 有时候，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1352.549, "timestamp": "00:22:32", "text": "全队的目光都集中在你身上，你可能会因此丧命"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1353.19, "timestamp": "00:22:33", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1355.669, "timestamp": "00:22:35", "text": "闪电击中。 哦，不过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1356.87, "timestamp": "00:22:36", "text": "我非常确定这不像你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1359.029, "timestamp": "00:22:39", "text": "性格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1361.51, "timestamp": "00:22:41", "text": "另外，我发现我和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1364.47, "timestamp": "00:22:44", "text": "绯红女巫配合得很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1370.4, "timestamp": "00:22:50", "text": "。 你只想玩《绯红》吗？ 因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1372.0, "timestamp": "00:22:52", "text": "你只想玩《绯红》吗？ 因为我 可以先讲讲斯嘉丽的故事，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1374.0, "timestamp": "00:22:54", "text": "可以先讲讲斯嘉丽的故事， 其他角色我们可以以后再说。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1375.84, "timestamp": "00:22:55", "text": "其他角色我们可以以后再说。   是的 。 是的。 当然。 当然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "t